{"id":"tonteri_a","lemma":"tontería","pos":"noun","rank":1053,"glosses":["dumb thing","trivial thing","nonsense, gibberish, baloney, malarkey (meaningless words)"],"ipa":"/tonteˈɾia/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tonterías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-tonter%C3%ADa.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Qué te hizo hacer esa tontería?","en":"What made you do a silly thing like that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/932208","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null]},{"text":"¡No digas tonterías!","en":"Don't talk nonsense!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/505516","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},null]},{"text":"Ya me he cansado de tus tonterías.","en":"I've had enough of your shenanigans.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611695","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"tired, weary, wearied"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Me parece una tontería.","en":"That sounds stupid.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448866","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Yo no he venido aquí a escuchar tonterías.","en":"I didn't come here to listen to this nonsense.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/741330","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to listen to"},null]}]}